WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.009 --> 00:00:15.011
couldn't see anything in the blinding light as she flew down and landed.

2
00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:22.034
A kind old woman greeted her.

3
00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:25.516
"My name is Rocket Girl," Roxy said.

4
00:00:25.536 --> 00:00:28.338
"I'm looking for the bodhisattva Guanyin.

5
00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:32.340
Someone told me she lives on Mount Potalaka in the South Sea."

6
00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:33.564
The woman nodded.

7
00:00:33.584 --> 00:00:36.145
"Yes, the bodhisattva lives there."

8
00:00:36.165 --> 00:00:41.726
"I flew all over the South Sea, but I didn't see the mountain," Roxy said.

9
00:00:41.746 --> 00:00:47.168
"You're not a spirit, so you can't travel to Mount Potalaka," the woman said.

10
00:00:47.188 --> 00:00:48.888
"But that's okay.

11
00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.349
I know why you're here."

12
00:00:50.369 --> 00:00:51.769
"You do?"

13
00:00:52.189 --> 00:00:53.470
Roxy said, surprised.

14
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.770
"Yes," the woman said.

15
00:00:55.790 --> 00:01:00.231
"I also know that your real name is Roxy."

16
00:01:00.912 --> 00:01:01.752
Roxy gasped.

17
00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:06.629
"Don't worry, I will protect your secret," the woman said.

18
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:10.350
Bright light flashed, and the woman disappeared.

19
00:01:12.551 --> 00:01:16.012
Then Roxy was back up in the sky, and a bird spirit appeared next to her.

20
00:01:16.032 --> 00:01:24.114
"I am Swift Wing, and I can open the portal for you," the spirit said.

21
00:01:24.134 --> 00:01:28.375
"Come!" Roxy quickly caught up to the spirit.

22
00:01:28.395 --> 00:01:30.556
"Who was that woman?"

23
00:01:32.248 --> 00:01:35.771
"She is the bodhisattva Guanyin," Swift Wing said.

24
00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:40.134
"You're not a spirit, so you can't see her in her true form."

25
00:01:43.576 --> 00:01:47.239
Roxy and Swift Wing soared through the air and found the Tang Monk and Wujing.

26
00:01:48.139 --> 00:01:49.240
The Tang Monk gasped.

27
00:01:50.921 --> 00:01:51.542
"Swift Wing!

28
00:01:51.962 --> 00:01:53.683
You look like a kind spirit now."

29
00:01:54.764 --> 00:01:56.165
Swift Wing spread her wings.

30
00:01:57.506 --> 00:02:00.528
"The bodhisattva Guanyin is teaching me to be good.

31
00:02:01.108 --> 00:02:04.290
I'm not evil anymore, and I feel much happier."

32
00:02:07.251 --> 00:02:08.612
Swift Wing recited a spell.

33
00:02:10.633 --> 00:02:12.434
Zoomp! The portal opened.

34
00:02:14.215 --> 00:02:18.137
"This is great!"

35
00:02:18.558 --> 00:02:19.298
Wukong said.

36
00:02:19.318 --> 00:02:21.619
"I've missed ruling over a kingdom."

37
00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.421
A large platform sat outside, in front of City Hall.

38
00:02:26.802 --> 00:02:30.184
In the center of the platform, Wukong sat on a magnificent throne.

39
00:02:30.852 --> 00:02:34.214
Monkeys and apes stood behind him, and Bajie was next to him.

40
00:02:34.234 --> 00:02:39.517
"I agree, Wukong," Bajie said proudly.

41
00:02:39.537 --> 00:02:42.799
"This is much more fun than traveling to the west."

42
00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:45.801
A crowd of people had gathered in the street.

43
00:02:47.141 --> 00:02:48.042
Mayor Bloom was there.

44
00:02:49.342 --> 00:02:51.324
Terrell, Jack, and Mara were in the crowd too.

45
00:02:51.344 --> 00:02:55.026
"All hail Sun Wukong!"

46
00:02:55.426 --> 00:02:56.246
a gorilla shouted.

47
00:02:57.407 --> 00:02:58.908
The monkeys and apes cheered.

48
00:03:03.936 --> 00:03:06.337
"King of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

49
00:03:06.697 --> 00:03:07.537
the gorilla cried.

50
00:03:08.737 --> 00:03:10.138
The monkeys and apes cheered again.

51
00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:17.440
of Metro City!"

52
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:18.860
the gorilla cried.

53
00:03:19.801 --> 00:03:26.723
The monkeys and apes cheered even more loudly as the gorilla shouted, "Everyone, bow before your new king!"

54
00:03:28.003 --> 00:03:28.903
All the people bowed.

55
00:03:29.884 --> 00:03:30.844
Many looked nervous.

56
00:03:31.892 --> 00:03:35.934
"I don't like Sun Wukong or the pig anymore," Jack whispered.

57
00:03:36.454 --> 00:03:37.154
Terrell nodded.

58
00:03:37.174 --> 00:03:40.356
"I wish Rocket Girl was here to stop them."

59
00:03:41.356 --> 00:03:43.497
"Who brought gifts for the Monkey King?"

60
00:03:43.937 --> 00:03:44.797
the gorilla asked.

61
00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.738
One by one, citizens stepped forward.

62
00:03:48.499 --> 00:03:52.761
Mara, Terrell, and Jack watched as people placed gifts in front of Wukong.

63
00:03:55.161 --> 00:03:57.843
A man from True Savings Bank presented sacks of money.

64
00:03:58.663 --> 00:04:00.984
A jewelry store owner handed over a diamond necklace.

65
00:04:01.928 --> 00:04:04.350
A baker brought cookies, muffins, and a large cake.

66
00:04:05.091 --> 00:04:07.833
The owner of Metro City Pizza walked up with several pizzas.

67
00:04:08.834 --> 00:04:10.055
Bajie's mouth watered.

68
00:04:10.956 --> 00:04:14.940
"Yum!" The gorilla cleared his throat.

69
00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:20.064
"All hail the—" "Sun Wukong stinks!"

70
00:04:20.564 --> 00:04:21.285
someone shouted.

71
00:04:22.086 --> 00:04:23.007
Everyone gasped.

72
00:04:23.827 --> 00:04:24.568
Mara pointed.

73
00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:26.289
"Rocket Girl!"

74
00:04:27.491 --> 00:04:28.832
Roxy floated over the crowd.

75
00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:31.902
"You're not our king, Wukong!"
